{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2024-chemistry-26","exam":"MDEET","year":2024,"subject":"chemistry","number":26,"points":4,"unitId":"organic_rxn","unitLabel":"유기 반응","classificationStatus":"editorial-content-based","stem":"다음은 라디칼 연쇄 반응(radical chain reaction)을 통해 일어\n나는 알케인(alkane)의 단일브로민화(monobromination) 반응이다.\n단일브로민화 생성물에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서\n있는 대로 고른 것은? (단, 각 반응에서는 적절한 분리･정제 과정을\n수행하였다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ.\n을 출발물로 하여 얻을 수 있는 생성물은\n7가지이다.\nㄴ.\n을 출발물로 하여 얻어지는 주생성물은\n이다.\nㄷ.\n을 출발물로 하여 얻어지는 주생성물은\n라세미 혼합물(racemic mixture)이다.","options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":4,"assets":[{"id":"fig-01","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-chemistry-26/01.webp","width":882,"height":155,"region":0,"bbox":[24.67,62.37,294.0,51.67],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[]},{"id":"fig-02","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-chemistry-26/02.webp","width":9,"height":9,"region":0,"bbox":[266.67,157.37,3.0,3.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[]},{"id":"fig-03","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-chemistry-26/03.webp","width":924,"height":639,"region":0,"bbox":[16.0,207.37,308.0,213.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"]}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[429.0,147.3,763.0,603.06],"width":334.0,"height":455.76,"items":[{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"26. 다음은 라디칼 연쇄 반응(radical chain reaction)을 통해 일어","bbox":[6.12,10.0,318.85,12.28],"spans":[{"text":"26.","bbox":[6.12,10.0,16.42,12.28],"origin":[6.12,19.02],"size":11.7,"flags":4,"font":"*ÇÑ¾ç°ß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":" 다음은 라디칼 연쇄 반응","bbox":[22.54,10.75,123.81,11.37],"origin":[22.54,19.02],"size":10.72,"flags":4,"font":"*½Å¸í-Áß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":"(","bbox":[145.8,10.87,4.13,11.25],"origin":[145.8,19.14],"s